  "title": "Jane A NDE 6915",
  "date": "1963",
  "content": "My mother was getting me ready or school. When she turned around, I was collapsed on the floor, unconscious, unresponsive, and not breathing. I have no memory of that morning or the collapse prior to coming back. I found myself floating in a huge bright void with the most incredible music, yet it was completely silent. It felt peaceful. There was no fear. I felt love. I felt I had to come back. I awoke suddenly and found myself on the floor with my mother giving me the kiss of life. I was happy, yet also sad when I returned. Since that experience, I have been different. I can sense things much more. I work as a healer and people tell me that they feel calm around me and that my hands get very warm when I am working on them. I frequently astral travel in my sleep. My husband died 12 years ago very suddenly and within hours of him passing, I could strongly sense his presence.",
